This package is a new extraction of Linux-visible seccomp policy and lifecycle
contracts designed for TheKernel and distributed under Apache-2.0.

The Linux and TheKernel snapshots listed in VENDOR.md were consulted to
understand observable UAPI, verifier-profile, filter-stack, action, inheritance,
and thread-synchronization contracts. No Linux source text is copied into this
package.

`thekernel-axcbpf` is an independently packaged Apache-2.0 dependency which
provides the policy-neutral classic-BPF verifier and interpreter mechanism. It
is not vendored into this archive.
